# Appel design

Read and follow `~/.cursor/skills/appel-design/SKILL.md` when changing UI.

- No rainbow / pink-orange gradients on screens, headers, or lists
- Buy CTA gradient only on the actual pay/buy button
- Use `useColors()` / `src/theme.ts` — no new palette
- Full labels, contrast in light and dark, 44pt hits, safe area
